--- a/forth/debugging/firmware.fs
+++ b/forth/debugging/firmware.fs
@@ -27,8 +27,9 @@
 \ 7.5.3    Dictionary
 
 \ 7.5.3.1    Dictionary search
-: .calls    ( xt -- )
-  ;
+\ .calls is implemented further down, after the body-walking helpers that both
+\ it and `patch` share -- a cross-reference is that same walk run over every
